 "_about": "Where a person revokes a leaked credential, by detection rule. A rule id matches the longest prefix below. 'where' is a page or a menu path that the provider's own documentation names (the 'docs' page, read 2026-11-17). A row's fourth field replaces the provider's 'where' for that token kind; 'settings' there, or a rule without a row, gives 'see the provider's settings': a rule that covers several token kinds, or a kind whose page the docs do not name. references/rotation.md has the steps.",
